     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The following changes apply to the PC version of the game",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed crashes on NVIDIA RTX 50-series GPUs with the latest drivers when entering the main campaign level from the intro sequence or loading a save game from the main menu.: Please ensure you've updated to the latest NVIDIA drivers.: If you’re experiencing any issues or have feedback, please check out our FAQ first. If you still can’t find a solution, feel free to reach out to us at support@survios.com, and we’ll assist you directly.: Thank you for your continued support and patience! Survios",
